###   S T A R T
execute if score @s abilities matches 50 run playsound minecraft:entity.zombie_villager.cure hostile @a ~ ~ ~ 0.8 0

###   L O O P
execute if score @s abilities matches 50..80 run playsound minecraft:block.stone.break hostile @a ~ ~ ~ 0.8 0.1
execute if score @s abilities matches 50..80 run particle block amethyst_block ~ ~ ~ 0.2 0.1 0.2 0 10 force

###   A B I L I T Y
